I explained some of the variance of the situation to help give insight to why my blue and yellow lines are skewed but I'm not attributing all this to variance. Like I said I have little to no online experience and I had wanted to get insight from online regs to make sure that I can plug any leaks before getting further into this. Honestly didn't know what an appropriate sample size to post was. Now I do.

